  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I got the Quest yesterday and wasn't able to save Quest avatars because my list is full of PC avatars and when i clicked on them a message popped up telling me that i can't wear them. But that also meant that the \"Unfavorite\" button was disabled. I guess it's because the avatar gets loaded on the left for preview purposes.\n\nMy suggestion is: Instead of loading them, display the PC robot thing as a preview instead, same like when you try to wear a PC avatar from a pedestal.",
